  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/main.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>您的個人安全倉庫*。</div>\n<div>*倉庫可能並非100%安全。Monobank Inc. 不對個人財產被盜或遺失負責。</div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Monobank 讓您安全存放大量相同物品。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/desc.png\" alt=\"Description\" width=\"1000\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/unlocking.png\" alt=\"Unlocking\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/lock_replacement.png\" alt=\"Lock Replacement\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/vault.png\" alt=\"Vault\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/vaults.png\" alt=\"Vaults\" width=\"1000\" height=\"491\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Monobank/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/Monobank/master/media/additional.png\" alt=\"Additional Info\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">由 <strong>Mischief of Mice</strong> 評測：</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wG-sgxrlkfM?si=k1_TbHY6cVGLljkt\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord Server\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持能讓我繼續開發它及其他模組！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\